        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Missile Volley"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The nightmarchers fling a hail of spears and stones, dealing 5d6+9 bludgeoning or piercing damage to creatures in a 10-foot burst within 20 feet (31 basic Reflex save). When the nightmarchers are reduced to 8 or fewer squares, this decreases to a 5-foot burst.\n\nStriking Koa 1A to 3A Frequency once per round; The troop attacks with spears, clubs, and leiomano against enemies within 5 feet (33 basic Reflex save) for their choice of bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage depending on the number of actions.\n\n1A 2d6+2 slashing damage 2A 4d6+12 slashing damage 3A 6d6+12 slashing damage."
            },
